    <string name="onboard_step">%1$d of %2$d</string>
    <string name="onboard_welcome_1">Athena is a reader and a shelf for long-form writing on nostr. Articles arrive as NIP-23 events; books as NKBIP-01 publications. You can also import an EPUB, PDF or text file and keep it on this device.</string>
